/-!
# A331018

Lexicographically earliest sequence of distinct positive terms that can be viewed as an irregular table where the n-th row has a(n) terms and for n > 1, T(n, k) is a multiple of k.

The 67 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A331018

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 4, 3, 6, 9, 8, 5, 10, 12,
    7, 14, 15, 16, 20, 18, 11, 22, 21, 24,
